description:
Fix JSON as LLMs often write it: removes ```json fences and surrounding prose, comments and trailing commas, converts single quotes, quotes bare keys, maps True/False/None, and closes unclosed brackets. Returns the repaired JSON and whether it now parses. Use when an LLM's JSON output fails to parse. Example: text=```json
{name: 'Ada', tags: ['x',],}
```. Price $0.01/call via x402 USDC or a card key (/credits), first 25 free; failed calls free. Reads or computes only and changes nothing; each call is charged, so repeats are not free.
